{%- comment -%}
  Product information panel.

  Rendered from sections/product-information.liquid rather than added to
  templates/product.json as a section: Shopify's GitHub sync stopped applying
  changes to that JSON template (its live copy is pinned to an older version
  while every Liquid file in the same pushes deploys normally), so the content
  has to arrive through a Liquid file to reach the store at all.

  These three bodies of text used to be accordions inside the buy column,
  where they competed with the price and the add to cart button for the same
  narrow strip, and pushed the button down the page every time one opened.

  Layout: the description leads at a reading measure, with the practical
  facts beside it as a short labelled list.

  The panel sits on its own white surface because that is this store's actual
  language: on the product page every element, the media card, the buy column,
  each product card below, is a white rounded card on the beige ground. An
  earlier pass set unstyled text directly on that ground, which read as content
  that had escaped its container rather than as a section.

  Inside the surface the description leads and the practical facts sit beside
  it, divided by a single rule. No cards within the card, no icons.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign panel_product = product -%}

<div class="product-info-panel">
  <div class="product-info-panel__surface page-width-content">
    <div class="product-info-panel__grid">
      {% if panel_product.description != blank %}
        <div class="product-info-panel__lead rte">{{ panel_product.description }}</div>
      {% endif %}

      <dl class="product-info-panel__facts">
        <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
          <dt>החומר</dt>
          <dd>עץ בוטיק, חיתוך לייזר בדיוק של שברירי מילימטר, תאורה רכה מבפנים.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
          <dt>זמן אספקה</dt>
          <dd>יוצא תוך 1 עד 3 ימי עסקים, מגיע תוך 2 עד 6 ימי עסקים.</dd>
        </div>
        <div class="product-info-panel__fact">
          <dt>החזרות</dt>
          <dd>14 יום להחזרה, משלוח ההחזרה על חשבוננו.</dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% style %}
  .product-info-panel {
    padding-block: 8px 72px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__surface {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(24, 24, 32, 0.05), 0 16px 40px rgba(24, 24, 32, 0.07);
    padding: 48px 52px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Same gold edge the product cards and banners carry. */
  .product-info-panel__surface::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 2;
    pointer-events: none;
    border-radius: inherit;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to left, rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.85), rgba(255, 209, 102, 0)) right bottom / 40% 1px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(255, 209, 102, 0.85), rgba(255, 209, 102, 0)) right bottom / 1px 40% no-repeat;
  }

  .product-info-panel__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.6fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: #33333d;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__lead p:last-child {
    margin-block-end: 0;
  }

  .product-info-panel__facts {
    margin: 0;
    padding-inline-start: 52px;
    border-inline-start: 1px solid rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.1);
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact + .product-info-panel__fact {
    margin-block-start: 24px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact dt {
    font-family: var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: #1a1a2e;
    margin-block-end: 6px;
  }

  .product-info-panel__fact dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #5a554d;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .product-info-panel {
      padding-block: 0 48px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__surface {
      padding: 32px 24px;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .product-info-panel__facts {
      padding-inline-start: 0;
      padding-block-start: 28px;
      border-inline-start: none;
      border-block-start: 1px solid rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.1);
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
